# The live refresher release this API's on-demand refreshes are proven with
# and released beside: the live refresher claims and settles the refresh
# requests the API records (POST /v1/refreshes); the two meet only in the
# database. `make live-e2e` runs this image against the database.pin release
# and the API built here; the image is private, so that run is a
# maintainer's, before a release, never public CI.
#
# Two lines, read by internal/release/livepin:
#   <image>:<X.Y.Z>@sha256:<digest>   the release, pinned by its digest
#   database <X.Y.Z>                  the viafrei-database release it reads
#                                     and writes: database.pin's
#
# Release order: viafrei-database, then the live refresher, then this API.
# Until the live refresher's release exists the image line ends in
# :unreleased; `go run ./internal/release/pinguard -live` (the release
# workflow) refuses it, a placeholder digest, and another database.
ghcr.io/mavrovde/viafrei-live-ingestor:0.1.0@sha256:a12948575cf2b2123ce2415a6c011ab1c0e21b8fe210d7b73f8434bc853a4b9d
database 0.3.3
